<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug fuel oil down 18.84 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug fuel oil down 18.84 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's fuel oil output was 15.52 million tonnes in the first eight months of 1996, down 18.84 percent compared with the same period last year, the Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>Fuel oil output in August alone was 1.81 million tonnes, the report said.</p>
</text>
